WEBVTT

00:04:56.715 --> 00:05:01.303
But I thank you here, Lois, from this platform.

00:05:01.303 --> 00:05:08.291
(Applause)

00:05:13.776 --> 00:05:20.635
I saw my first Apple computer in 1984,

00:05:20.635 --> 00:05:22.160
and I thought to myself,

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:27.128
"This thing's got a glass screen, not much use to me."

00:05:27.128 --> 00:05:31.182
How very wrong I was.